          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A carpenter charges a flat rate of \\$156 for the first 2 hours of work and \\$65 for each additional\nhour of work. Which equation gives the total amount $y$, in dollars, that the carpenter charges for $x$\nhours of work, where $x \\gt 2$?"
        }
